{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Reference dashboard for the health of an NKE site controller. Requires a `k8s_cluster_name` label on the queried series. It is not deployed by the nke-stack composition; import this JSON and select a Prometheus datasource. Core rows cover NKE, SPIRE, Temporal, cert-manager, and node health. Control-plane, PostgreSQL/CNPG, Argo CD, Longhorn, and Teleport rows are optional and stay empty when those components are not installed or not scraped.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 0,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Scope\nReference health dashboard for a single NKE site-controller cluster. It is not deployed by the nke-stack composition. Import this JSON and select a Prometheus datasource.\n\n### Assumptions\n- Every queried series carries a `k8s_cluster_name` label identifying the site controller (Prometheus label from the OpenTelemetry resource attribute `k8s.cluster.name`). On a plain kube-prometheus install that stamps `cluster` instead, rewrite the selector or relabel at ingest.\n- kube-state-metrics is installed, which the nke-stack composition provides through kube-prometheus-stack.\n- The NKE controller workload is either `cloud-workflow-engine` (existing sites and default nke-stack `nameOverride`) or `nke-controller` (greenfield Helm values). Ready / version / restart panels match both.\n\n### Required metrics\n- **kube-state-metrics:** deployment, StatefulSet, DaemonSet, pod readiness, container restart, node condition, and node info series\n\n### Optional metrics\n- **Kubernetes control plane:** `up{job=\"apiserver\"}`, `apiserver_request_total`, and `etcd_*`. These need kube-apiserver and etcd scrape targets, which are not configured by default.\n- **PostgreSQL / CNPG:** PostgreSQL pod readiness, and `cnpg_*` when CloudNativePG is used\n- **Argo CD:** kube-state-metrics series for the `argocd` namespace\n- **Longhorn:** `longhorn_volume_*`\n- **Teleport:** kube-state-metrics series for `teleport*` namespaces\n\nOptional panels read **Not installed** or **No scrape** rather than failing. PostgreSQL and CNPG health are reported as ready-over-discovered ratios, so a single-instance PostgreSQL is healthy at 100%; no replica count is assumed.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Requirements and scope",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Core Site Controller Health",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "NKE controller ready replicas divided by desired replicas.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Down"
                },
                "1": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Ready"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "(kube_deployment_status_replicas_ready{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",namespace=~\"cloud-workflow-engine|nke-controller\",deployment=~\"cloud-workflow-engine|nke-controller\"} / clamp_min(kube_deployment_spec_replicas{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",namespace=~\"cloud-workflow-engine|nke-controller\",deployment=~\"cloud-workflow-engine|nke-controller\"}, 1)) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "NKE",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "NKE Ready",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "NKE controller image version running on the selected site controller.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "fixedColor": "blue",
            "mode": "fixed"
          },
          "noValue": "Unknown"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "label_replace(group by (image) (kube_pod_container_info{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",namespace=~\"cloud-workflow-engine|nke-controller\",container=~\"cloud-workflow-engine|nke-controller\"}), \"version\", \"$1\", \"image\", \".*:(.*)\")",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{version}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "NKE Version",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "NKE controller container restarts during the selected time range.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",namespace=~\"cloud-workflow-engine|nke-controller\",container=~\"cloud-workflow-engine|nke-controller\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Restarts",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "NKE Restarts",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
